#
#   event_loop_plugin - Platform::EventLoopPlugin: LibWeb's access to the process's event loop
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Platform/EventLoopPlugin.cpp (lines 1-50) over the Core event
#       loop seam (external/lib_core/event_loop.lucb), which the embedder implements.
